### Week 12 REST API requests (VS Code REST Client extension)
# Run php artisan serve --host=0.0.0.0 --port=8000 first.
# Click "Send Request" above each request from INSIDE Codespaces.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. All students
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students
Accept: application/json

### 3. One student
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create (check the returned id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Pedro Reyes",
  "course": "BSIT",
  "year_level": 2
}

### 5. Edit — change id to the one returned by POST
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/students/3
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "course": "BSCS"
}

### 6. Delete — change id to the created record
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/students/3
Accept: application/json

### 7. Validation demonstration (422 error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "course": ""
}
